    188 U00bc		       00 f0	   PlayerBombs =	$F0	; bombs left in b2-0 (0..5; readers mask, see
    189 U00bc							; below). b7 = bank1 RaftBody's "ridden last
    190 U00bc							; frame" flag, b6-b3 = its take-off ramp level
    191 U00bc							; (0-15) — the raft's inertia state lives here
    192 U00bc							; because the ZP map has no free byte (AGENTS).
    193 U00bc							; Contract: only the raft writes b7-3; the bomb
    194 U00bc							; code touches b2-0 (its `dec` is guarded by a
    195 U00bc							; nonzero count, so it cannot borrow upward);
    196 U00bc							; LoadLevel/ReloadLevel write the whole byte,
