   1071  f1f1							; Vertical movement — HERO-style jetpack physics
   1072  f1f1							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   1073  f1f1							; Gravity pulls down, holding Up fires jetpack (JetPower ramps with inertia).
   1074  f1f1							; Velocity is integrated through PlayerYSub and walked pixel-by-pixel via
   1075  f1f1							; StepDown/StepUp so collision stops flush at walls/doorways.
   1076  f1f1							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
