   1149  f24a							; --- Physics: vy += GRAVITY (gravity), vy -= JetPower (jet thrust). ---
   1150  f24a							;     JetPower b7 = float flag (bugs #31): float frames add gravity
   1151  f24a							;     only — subtracting $80+ would blast the player upward.
   1152  f24a				   .Gravity
