   1350  f34f							; StepDown: try one pixel of downward movement (called per pixel of vy).
   1351  f34f							; A pixel is rejected when the footprint enters a solid tile (player lands
   1352  f34f							; and vy is zeroed). At PLAYER_MAX_Y the room's down connection is followed.
