   1426  f3b0							; UpdateEnemies — per-type live motion from RAM shadow (overscan).
   1427  f3b0							; E0: loop runs EVERY frame; each type carries its own speed gate (snake
   1428  f3b0							; ÷4 here; bat ungated, spider ÷8, tentacle ÷2/÷8, moth ÷2 in E1-E4).
   1429  f3b0							; Snake patrol: bounds are SYMMETRIC about the ROM spawn X (± SNAKE_PATROL =
   1430  f3b0							; one tile, user 2026-10-19 — see the constant): retreat a tile behind the
   1431  f3b0							; placement, come out a tile, repeat. The ROM dir names the side it comes OUT
   1432  f3b0							; on: the loader inverts a snake's live dir at room load (bank2 EnterRoomB2),
   1433  f3b0							; so the first move is the retreat into its wall. Ignores editor range_* per
   1434  f3b0							; user 2026-09-23. No wall collision.
   1435  f3b0							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
