   1673  f4d5							; Room exit handlers — check connection table, switch rooms, reposition player
   1674  f4d5							; ==============================================================================
   1675  f4d5							; Connection table: 2 nibble-packed bytes per room (up<<4|down, left<<4|right),
   1676  f4d5							; $F = no exit. After transition: player is placed at the OPPOSITE edge of the
   1677  f4d5							; new room. Jetpack velocity carries over (matches comparison/hero pattern).
   1678  f4d5							; GetConnIdx moved to bank1 (leaf_move_plan batch B) — CallPad_GetConnIdx.
