   1882  f5e5							; TallyArm (bank2, via TallyTramp) snapshots time/bombs/lives into
   1883  f5e5							; TallyTicks and sets DropTarget=$FE; each frame's dispatch then runs
   1884  f5e5							; TallyWork, whose done path does the old tail (level++/LoadLevel/bar).
