   2332  f800							; CEH_Key — type-6 key pickup (docs/feature_tiles_plan.md Phase 5): latch
   2333  f800							; KeyHeld ($A7 b7) and mark the key slot dead so it vanishes, with NO life
   2334  f800							; loss. X = EnemyIndex (set by CheckEnemyHit's hit path); reached via
   2335  f800							; `jmp CEH_Key` from that dispatch. Lives in the $F82C pre-pad pin gap
   2336  f800							; (177B slack before the $F8DD sprite pin); pre-pad END headroom is 1B but
   2337  f800							; this region is upstream of the pin, so it costs nothing at $FC67.
   2338  f800							; KEY is one per level, so KeyHeld is a single bit (no per-key storage).
   2339  f800							; LevelStartRoom b7 resets when LoadLevel rewrites $A7 (:1875) before its own
   2340  f800							; read at :1922, so no reader mask is needed; KeyHeld survives room changes
   2341  f800							; and normal deaths, resets on game-over reload.
   2342  f800							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   2343  f800				   CEH_Key
   2344  f800		       a5 ba		      lda	EnemyDeadMask
   2345  f802		       1d ac f3 	      ora	EnemyBitTable,X
   2346  f805		       85 ba		      sta	EnemyDeadMask
   2347  f807		       a5 a7		      lda	LevelStartRoom
   2348  f809		       09 80		      ora	#$80	; KeyHeld = b7
   2349  f80b		       85 a7		      sta	LevelStartRoom
   2350  f80d		       60		      rts
