   2678  f9c4							; $F9C4..$FBF7 fill (ReturnPad pin at $FBF8 unaffected; F6-safe:
   2679  f9c4							; $F9C4 & $1FFF = $19C4 ∉ $1FF6-$1FF9; bank0-only, not a fold twin).
