   2685  f9c4							;		     (passed to SetObjectXPos as M1X+1 — Stella draws 8-wide
   2686  f9c4							;		     M1 one clock left of the [A-7,A] player contract).
   2687  f9c4							;		     ENAM1 latched #$02 for the whole cave (hero-style: 2
