   3208  fda2							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   3209  fda2							; BuildColupF — 12-byte final COLUPF image at ColupfBuf ($E7-$F2).
   3210  fda2							;   Stripe: rows 0,2 = LevelWallColor; row 1 = LevelWallColor2.
   3211  fda2							;   Hot rows overwrite with TickCounter-bit4 pulse (COLOR_HOT_Y/R).
   3212  fda2							;   $F0-$F2 (bombs) NO LONGER overlap-saved: body writes rows 0-2 only,
   3213  fda2							;   save/restore round trip deleted (S3.0b — window audit: zero writers).
   3214  fda2							;   Bank1 clobbers $E0-$EF during HUD; VBLANK rebuilds every frame.
   3215  fda2							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   3216  fda2							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   3217  fda2							; BuildColupF — MOVED to bank2 (S5.1) — CallPad_BuildColupF.
   3218  fda2							;   Hot-rect data (RoomRects) lives in bank2, so the body reads it with
   3219  fda2							;   direct (FetchPtr),Y — the shared $FEF6 fold block's sta $1FF6 always
   3220  fda2							;   returns to bank0, so a fold inside a bank1 body could not work.
   3221  fda2							;   The dark check is inlined there too: CallPad_IsRoomDark cannot nest
   3222  fda2							;   from a pad body (ReturnPad switches to bank0 mid-call).
   3223  fda2							;   Body: bank2.asm, pinned at $FC4F. Entry save block ($F0-$F2 → collision
   3224  fda2							;   temps) was dead (rows 0-2 only) — deleted with the .AfterRows restore
   3225  fda2							;   in S3.0b.
   3226  fda2							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   3227  fda2
   3228  fda2							; UpdateBombSound moved to bank1 (leaf_move_plan batch A) — CallPad_UpdateBombSound.
   3229  fda2
   3230  fda2							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   3231  fda2							; ColOff/ColMask — cell-walk lookup tables (cell_collision_plan).
   3232  fda2							;   Indexed by LEFT-HALF source col 0-19 (PHM prologue mirrors right-half
   3233  fda2							;   ranges before the walk; bank2 display-space walkers mirror first too).
   3234  fda2							;   ColOff: byte offset from PF0Buf+row ($C3+row) to the register holding
   3235  fda2							;   that col (0/3/6 = PF0/PF1/PF2 row byte). ColMask: the col's bit in that
   3236  fda2							;   byte — PF0 bit4+col (cols 0-3), PF1 MSB-first (4-11), PF2 LSB-first
   3237  fda2							;   (12-19); matches convert_room.pf_values (plan 0.2 spec, proven by
   3238  fda2							;   tools/test_cell_map.py).
   3239  fda2							;   (The standalone CellSolid leaf that lived here moved INTO
   3240  fda2							;   PlayerHitsMap's walk as inline code — a jsr in the walk cost 2B of
   3241  fda2							;   stack depth and would break sim_bomb_fuse's gameplay min-SP >= $F8
   3242  fda2							;   guard; the post-pad slot keeps these tables abs,X-reachable.)
   3243  fda2							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   3244  fda2		       00 00 00 00*ColOff     .byte.b	0,0,0,0, 3,3,3,3,3,3,3,3, 6,6,6,6,6,6,6,6
   3245  fdb6		       10 20 40 80*ColMask    .byte.b	$10,$20,$40,$80,$80,$40,$20,$10,$08,$04,$02,$01
   3246  fdc2		       01 02 04 08*	      .byte.b	$01,$02,$04,$08,$10,$20,$40,$80
   3247  fdca
   3248  fdca							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   3249  fdca							; BombEnemyBlast — bank2 entry tramp ($FDD8, lamp-safe S9 2026-10-07): the
   3250  fdca							; BombTick `jsr` lands here (bank0), `sta $1FF8` switches to bank2, the `jmp`
   3251  fdca							; is fetched from bank2's byte-identical mirror at this same address and
   3252  fdca							; lands on the body at $FD87 (the lamp type-check reads enemy records that
   3253  fdca							; live in bank2). Body tail-jmps ReturnPad ($FBF8); A = 1 kill (BombTick
   3254  fdca							; awards +50 — pads cannot nest), 0 none. Old inline body ($F87F, 66B)
   3255  fdca							; deleted: the region re-packs into the gap before the $FBD6 fold pin
   3256  fdca							; (pre-pad headroom stays 1B — pins absorb upstream shrink, not the org).
   3257  fdca							; TWIN: bank2.asm mirrors these exact 6 bytes at $FDD8 (the pad after
   3258  fdca							; .HOVdone). The PickPlayerFrame `.ds $FDE1` below absorbs the size.
   3259  fdca							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   3260  fdca		       00 00 00 00*	      .ds	$FDD8 - *, 0	; pin: bank2's blast-tramp mirror is at $FDD8
   3261  fdd8				   BombEnemyBlast
   3262  fdd8		       8d f8 1f 	      sta	$1FF8
   3263  fddb		       4c 87 fd 	      jmp	$FD87	; BombEnemyBlastBody (bank2.lst — after
   3264  fdde							;   .HOVfeature; NOT in the TitleJetColors
   3265  fdde							;   span)
   3266  fdde							;   (2026-10-13: was $FD79 — crush-kill b6
   3267  fdde							;   latch + feature gate pushed +14; same day
   3268  fdde							;   was $FD6C — .HOVfeature pushed +13; 2026-
   3269  fdde							;   10-10: was $FD6B — 1-byte stale operand =
   3270  fdde							;   entry mid-instruction at `lda EnemyCount+1`;
   3271  fdde							;   garbage path's `inc $4A,X` set wall bits
   3272  fdde							;   via $CA)
   3273  fdde
   3274  fdde							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   3275  fdde							; PickPlayerFrame — VBL entry tramp: the VBL `jsr` lands here (bank0), `sta
   3276  fdde							; $1FF8` switches to bank2, the `jmp` is fetched from bank2's byte-identical
   3277  fdde							; mirror at this same address and lands on bank2's body ($F3C4). The body
   3278  fdde							; tail-jmps ReturnPad ($FBF8) -> `sta $1FF6/rts` returns to the VBL jsr
   3279  fdde							; (BuildColupF pad pattern; 0 extra stack depth).
   3280  fdde							; Guards: verify_build check_frame_tramp (byte-identity + operand = bank2
   3281  fdde							; label). Body logic: jet flutter (PlayerSpriteA/B) > walk (PlayerWalkA/B) >
   3282  fdde							; static A; phase EnemyRamP&$08 (walk, 16-frame) / TickCounter&4 (jet).
   3283  fdde							; PINNED: bank2's mirror is address-frozen at $FDE1 — the TitleSelect
   3284  fdde							; TitleWork shrink (2026-10-06) moved this −20B and broke byte-identity;
